International Continence Society. ICS glossary: pad testing.

European Association of Urology. EAU guidelines on non-neurogenic female lower urinary tract symptoms. Section 3.7: Pad testing. Arnhem: EAU Guidelines Office; 2026.">
		["MD5-CAM-1.0.1"] = <"265046ffc296dd48cd05140a9988ea0d">
